# openai/whisper-large-v3 - seq2seq ASR full fine-tune on LibriSpeech (measured: see README results table)
# NOTE: this recipe only works because scripts/prepare_librispeech.py writes SENTENCE-CASED training
# targets. An earlier revision trained on LibriSpeech's raw upper-case transcripts instead, which
# regressed dev-clean WER (2.25% -> 3.34%) by fragmenting words Whisper already transcribes
# correctly zero-shot into upper-case BPE pieces -- see chapter 03 and EVIDENCE.md for the full story.
MODEL=models/whisper-large-v3
DATASET=data/librispeech/manifests/train_full.jsonl
OUTPUT_DIR=runs/whisper-large-v3
MODEL_KIND=seq2seq
ADAPTER=
: "${LR:=1e-5}"
: "${BATCH:=4}"
